      "description": "Labelled square search field with a stronger border and visible focus ring.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\" for=\"ds-query\">搜尋竹笛札記<input class=\"ds-input\" id=\"ds-query\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜尋文章、曲名或練習問題\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:14px;color:hsl(var(--primary))}.ds-input{display:flex;width:100%;height:44px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--input));border-radius:0;background:hsl(var(--card));color:hsl(var(--foreground));padding:8px 12px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16px;caret-color:hsl(var(--accent));transition:color 180ms,background-color 180ms,border-color 180ms,box-shadow 180ms}.ds-input::placeholder{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px hsl(var(--ring))}.ds-input:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}@media(min-width:768px){.ds-input{font-size:14px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-input{transition:none}}"
